{"repositoryId":1388129896,"availability":"available","full":"lennmoe/vnrpc","name":"vnrpc","description":"Discord rich presence for visual novels, with a library, reading time tracker, VNDB covers and screenshots.","category":"Other","language":"Rust","stars":45,"forks":1,"created":"2026-09-25T19:57:37Z","updated":"2026-10-19T18:48:17Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://vnrpc-docs.vercel.app","topics":["discord-rpc","visual-novels","vn","vndb","windows"],"demo":"https://vnrpc-docs.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T05:27:45.945Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-20T05:27:45.945Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-20T05:27:45.945Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T03:00:28.582Z","stars":44,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-20T05:27:45.945Z","stars":45,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Show the visual novel you're reading on your Discord profile: the game, your current chapter or route, the time read and its cover.","A small Windows tray app, written in Rust with Tauri. It reads the title of the VN's window, so most engines work without any setup. One light .exe (about 9 MB), nothing else to install."],"features":["Finds the VN by itself (Ren'Py, KiriKiri, SiglusEngine, BGI…), or you pick the window by hand.","Shows where you are: prologue, chapter, route or ending, read from the window title (English, French, Japanese).","Tracks time read for each VN, with a day-by-day history, a reading calendar with streaks, and your progress against the average length on VNDB. You can also set it by hand.","Covers from VNDB or an image link.","Privacy per game: everything, no chapter, just \"Visual Novel\", or nothing. NSFW covers stay blurred and off Discord unless you allow them."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lennmoe/vnrpc/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d25ae87926ba723a4004b7a53ae23dac0d816b296f07608d70093e97c0524b12","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:28.717Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T05:27:4